      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "SNEAKO explains the most wild experience he had in his home country after he randomly saw his long lost uncle in a random Philippines Cafe\u2026\ud83d\ude33\ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\udded \n\n\u201cThere is millions of people in this city and somehow I sit right in front of my uncle. Allah is truly the best of planners.\u201d\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/SNEAKOHQ/status/2049651047233409408",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-30T00:44:24+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Last day of the SEA tour tomorrow \ud83d\ude22",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/sneako/status/2049522944683176002",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-29T16:15:22+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Thank you Erna for showing us Manila \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\udded",
